.Sh CAVEATS
On
.Fx ,
the IPv6 link-local address of a
.Xr pppoe 4
interface comes from IPv6CP.
The driver therefore clears the
.Cm auto_linklocal
flag (see
.Xr ifconfig 8 )
on every change to the interface flags, so
.Ql ifconfig pppoe0 inet6 auto_linklocal
does not survive the next
.Cm up
or
.Cm down .
